---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About | Ratan Dhanjal — DevOps & Cloud Engineer"
  description="About Ratan Dhanjal — DevOps Lead and Cloud Engineer with 7+ years of experience in cloud infrastructure, Kubernetes, Terraform, CI/CD, DevSecOps, and platform engineering."
>
  <div class="container page-container fade-in">
    <header class="page-header stagger-1">
      <h1 class="font-serif">About Me</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Engineering reliable infrastructure. Automating everything possible.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="content-grid">
      <!-- Main Content -->
      <div class="main-content stagger-2">

        <h2>Professional Profile</h2>
        <p>
          I'm a DevOps Lead and Cloud Engineer with over 7 years of hands-on experience designing, automating, and operating
          cloud infrastructure and platform engineering solutions. My career began in networking and IT infrastructure,
          giving me deep foundational knowledge of how systems connect, communicate, and fail — knowledge that directly
          informs how I design resilient cloud architectures today.
        </p>
        <p>
          Over the years, I've progressed from infrastructure management to cloud engineering, and now lead DevOps and
          platform engineering initiatives for enterprise-scale programs. I specialise in Azure cloud infrastructure,
          Infrastructure as Code with Terraform, container orchestration on Kubernetes (AKS), CI/CD pipeline engineering,
          GitOps-based delivery, and DevSecOps practices.
        </p>

        <h2>Technical Domains</h2>
        <p>
          My core expertise spans several interconnected disciplines. In <strong>cloud infrastructure</strong>, I architect
          and operate Azure environments, managing everything from virtual networking, load balancers, and private
          connectivity to AKS cluster lifecycle management and container registry operations.
        </p>
        <p>
          In <strong>Infrastructure as Code</strong>, I use Terraform to create consistent, version-controlled, and
          repeatable provisioning workflows. I implement security scanning at the IaC layer using TFSec and TruffleHog
          to catch misconfigurations and secrets before they reach production.
        </p>
        <p>
          For <strong>CI/CD and GitOps</strong>, I build and optimise end-to-end pipelines using Azure DevOps, GitHub
          Actions, and GitLab CI — integrated with ArgoCD for declarative, Git-driven deployments to Kubernetes. I've
          led Blue-Green deployment strategies and rollback automation for production AKS workloads.
        </p>
        <p>
          In <strong>observability</strong>, I implement monitoring stacks using Prometheus and Grafana, set up
          structured alerting, and integrate Azure Monitor to provide engineering teams with actionable insight into
          system health and performance.
        </p>

        <h2>Engineering Approach</h2>
        <p>
          I believe that the best infrastructure is infrastructure that engineers forget about — because it simply works.
          My approach is built on a few core principles: <strong>automate everything repetitive</strong>,
          <strong>treat infrastructure as code</strong>, <strong>make security a pipeline concern not an afterthought</strong>,
          and <strong>design for observability from day one</strong>.
        </p>
        <p>
          I prefer solutions that are maintainable by a team rather than impressive only to their author. Clean,
          well-documented, version-controlled infrastructure is the foundation of operational reliability — and that
          is where I focus my engineering energy.
        </p>

        <h2>Background</h2>
        <p>
          Before specialising in cloud and DevOps, I spent years in networking, IT infrastructure, and field engineering.
          That breadth of experience — from hardware and physical networks to enterprise cloud platforms — gives me a
          pragmatic, systems-thinking perspective that I bring to every architecture decision.
        </p>

      </div>

      <!-- Sidebar -->
      <aside class="sidebar stagger-3">
        <div class="card glass-effect">
          <h3>Quick Facts</h3>
          <ul class="fact-list">
            <li><strong>Experience</strong> 7+ years in DevOps & Cloud Engineering</li>
            <li><strong>Background</strong> Networking → IT → Cloud → DevOps</li>
            <li><strong>Primary Cloud</strong> Microsoft Azure</li>
            <li><strong>IaC</strong> Terraform</li>
            <li><strong>Container Platform</strong> Kubernetes / AKS</li>
            <li><strong>CI/CD</strong> Azure DevOps, GitHub Actions, GitLab</li>
            <li><strong>GitOps</strong> ArgoCD</li>
            <li><strong>Security</strong> SonarQube, TFSec, TruffleHog</li>
            <li><strong>Observability</strong> Prometheus, Grafana, Azure Monitor</li>
            <li><strong>Scripting</strong> Python, PowerShell, Bash, Azure CLI</li>
            <li><strong>Location</strong> India</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="card glass-effect links-card">
          <h3>Explore More</h3>
          <nav class="sidebar-links" aria-label="Related pages">
            <a href="/work" class="sidebar-link" id="sidebar-work-link">
              <span class="sidebar-link-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="7" rx="2"/><path d="M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"/></svg>
              </span>
              Work Experience
            </a>
            <a href="/projects" class="sidebar-link" id="sidebar-projects-link">
              <span class="sidebar-link-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m18 16 4-4-4-4"/><path d="m6 8-4 4 4 4"/><path d="m14.5 4-5 16"/></svg>
              </span>
              Open Source Projects
            </a>
            <a href="/blog" class="sidebar-link" id="sidebar-blog-link">
              <span class="sidebar-link-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2H20v20H6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5H20"/></svg>
              </span>
              Technical Writing
            </a>
            <a href="/contact" class="sidebar-link" id="sidebar-contact-link">
              <span class="sidebar-link-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"/><path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"/></svg>
              </span>
              Get in Touch
            </a>
          </nav>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-container {
    padding-top: var(--space-2xl);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-4xl);
  }

  .page-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3xl);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .font-serif {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .subtitle {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .content-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-3xl);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .main-content h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    font-size: 1.75rem;
  }

  .main-content h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .main-content p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .main-content strong {
    color: var(--text-color);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* ── Sidebar ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .sidebar {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .sidebar .card {
    background-color: var(--bg-color-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-xl);
    position: sticky;
    top: 100px;
  }

  .links-card {
    position: static !important;
  }

  .sidebar h3 {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  /* ── Quick Facts ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .fact-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .fact-list li {
    padding: var(--space-sm) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .fact-list li:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .fact-list strong {
    color: var(--text-color);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    display: block;
  }

  /* ── Sidebar Links ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .sidebar-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .sidebar-link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-md);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    transition: all var(--transition-fast);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .sidebar-link:hover {
    color: var(--text-color);
    background-color: var(--bg-color);
    border-color: var(--border-color);
  }

  .sidebar-link-icon {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  /* ── Stagger ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .stagger-1, .stagger-2, .stagger-3 {
    opacity: 0;
    animation: slideUp var(--transition-slow) forwards;
  }
  .stagger-1 { animation-delay: 100ms; }
  .stagger-2 { animation-delay: 200ms; }
  .stagger-3 { animation-delay: 300ms; }

  /* ── Responsive ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .content-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .sidebar .card {
      position: static;
    }
  }
</style>
